></span>)<span class="_ _0"> </span>×<span class="_ _2"> </span>(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ff8">𝑀<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>×<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐷<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)<span class="_ _1"></span></span>，即</div><div class="t m0 x6f h14 y11dc ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x7b h14 y11dd ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _5"></span>𝑌</div><div class="t m0 x8a h12 y11db ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑊</div><div class="t m0 x30 h14 y11de ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 xba h6 y11db ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">。</div><div class="t m0 xbd h7 y11df ff3 fs1 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.</div><div class="t m0 x2c h14 y11e0 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x9 h14 y11e1 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕𝑊</div><div class="t m0 xbb h6 y11df ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">的维度必须与<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑊<span class="_ _20"> </span></span>相同<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝐷<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">×<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>𝑀<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</span>。<span class="_ _5"></span>我们有<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑋<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ff3">(<span class="_ _1"></span></span>𝑁<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffa">×<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>𝐷<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ff3">)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>和</div><div class="t m0 x24 h14 y11e0 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x24 h14 y11e1 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _5"></span>𝑌</div><div class="t m0 xcd h6 y11df ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝑁<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffa">×<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>𝑀<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)<span class="ff4">。<span class="_ _3"></span>唯一能生成<span class