div class="t m0 xf h10 y11e9 ff9 fs4 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff6">7.5<span class="_ _5f"> </span><span class="ff1">卷积神经网络<span class="_ _e"> </span></span>(CNN)</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y11ea ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">对于图像等高维数据，<span class="_ _45"></span>全连接网络面临参数量爆炸的问题。<span class="_ _3c"></span>卷积神经网络通过<span class="ff1">局部连接<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff6">(Local<span class="_ _c"> </span>Connectivity)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 y11eb ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">和<span class="ff1">权值共享<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(W<span class="_ _28"></span>eight<span class="_ _0"> </span>Sharing)<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">有效解决了这一问题。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xf h16 y11ec ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.5.1<span class="_ _21"> </span><span class="ff1">卷积层与参数效率</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y11ed ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">7.5.1</span></div><div class="t m0 x10 h11 y11ee ffa fs1 fc9 sc0 ls0 ws0">♣</div><div class="t m0 x53 h3 y11ef ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">给定输入图像<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐼<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>和卷积核<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐾<span class="_ _15"></span></span>（尺寸<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑘<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffa">×<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>𝑘<span class="_ _15"></span></span>）<span class="_ _29"></span>，卷积层的输出（特征图）<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝑆<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>定义为：</div><div class="t m0 x80 h11 y11f0 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑆<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span></span>𝑖<span class="_ _1"></span>,<span class="_ _2"> </span>𝑗<span class="_ _12"></span><span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _20"> </span></span>(<span class="_ _15"></span></span>𝐼<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffa">∗<span class="_ 